[SetUp "1"]

{ Which new pawn lever attacks h5, and what active counterplay can Black prepare? Explain Black's plan after any necessary White reply. Answer: The h-pawns face one another after ...h5. The h-file is closed for now, but White can create a new lever with g4. Finish development and create central or queenside counterplay. Defend forcing threats directly. Keep a defender near g6 and avoid unnecessary dark-square weaknesses. White: White may play g4, sacrifice on h5, or exchange the g7 bishop with Bh6. A blocked h-file is not permanent safety. }
*

